From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Norman Herms <dockseed@proton.me>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 07:39:26 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: allwinner: a733: add the TWI0 controller

The Radxa Cubie A7S has its EEPROM on TWI0, which the A733 device tree
does not describe, so the board cannot reach it.

Add the TWI0 controller as i2c0, disabled, and its pin group on PG8
(SCK) and PG9 (SDA). The node has the form of r_i2c0 and uses the same
compatible chain. The values (page numbers are pages of the UM PDF):

- Registers at 0x02510000, size 0x400: UM V1.00 memory map (PDF p.26).
- Interrupt 43, which is GIC_SPI 11: UM V1.00 interrupt table (PDF p.614).
- Clock and reset: CLK_BUS_I2C0 and RST_BUS_I2C0 of the A733 CCU, whose
  gate and reset bits sit at offset 0xe80.
- PG8 and PG9 select function 6, TWI0, in PG_CFG1 (UM V1.00 PDF p.1720).

The pin group is /omit-if-no-ref/, as the neighbouring ones are, and the
node is disabled, so no board changes unless it enables the controller.

Not covered: enabling the controller on a board.

Tested on Radxa Cubie A7S: TWI0 probes on PG8/PG9 and the EEPROM on it
answers and reads back.

Assisted-by: LLM
---
 .../arm64/boot/dts/allwinner/sun60i-a733.dtsi | 20 +++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 20 insertions(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/allwinner/sun60i-a733.dtsi b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/allwinner/sun60i-a733.dtsi
index fab122ae626c..9a74859f8b97 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/allwinner/sun60i-a733.dtsi
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/allwinner/sun60i-a733.dtsi
@@ -487,6 +487,13 @@ pio: pinctrl@2000000 {
 			interrupt-controller;
 			#interrupt-cells = <3>;
 
+			/omit-if-no-ref/
+			i2c0_pg_pins: i2c0-pg-pins {
+				pins = "PG8", "PG9";
+				allwinner,pinmux = <6>;
+				function = "i2c0";
+			};
+
 			/omit-if-no-ref/
 			i2s0_pb_pins: i2s0-pb-pins {
 				pins = "PB4", "PB5", "PB6", "PB7", "PB8";
@@ -668,6 +675,19 @@ uart4: serial@2504000 {
 			status = "disabled";
 		};
 
+		i2c0: i2c@2510000 {
+			compatible = "allwinner,sun60i-a733-i2c",
+				     "allwinner,sun8i-v536-i2c",
+				     "allwinner,sun6i-a31-i2c";
+			reg = <0x02510000 0x400>;
+			interrupts = <GIC_SPI 11 IRQ_TYPE_LEVEL_HIGH 0>;
+			clocks = <&ccu CLK_BUS_I2C0>;
+			resets = <&ccu RST_BUS_I2C0>;
+			status = "disabled";
+			#address-cells = <1>;
+			#size-cells = <0>;
+		};
+
 		ths: thermal-sensor@2522000 {
 			compatible = "allwinner,sun60i-a733-ths";
 			reg = <0x02522000 0x400>;
